<title>USA: Fed confirms repo action totalled $5.250 billion.</title>
<headline>Fed confirms repo action totalled $5.250 billion.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve's system repurchase operation on Friday totalled $5.250 billion, a Fed spokeswoman confirmed.</p>
<p>(( -- E. Freilich, N.American, Treasury Desk 212-859-1679))</p>
